---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

---
<Layout modern title="Golf Cart Rental Options in Ocala | Plan Your Rental" description="Choose a 2, 4 or 6-passenger golf cart for your stay in Ocala. Compare rental options, prepare your dates and request a complete quote.">
<article class="guide"><header class="hero"><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="kicker"><span></span> Golf cart rentals / Ocala</p><h1>More people.<br/>More plans.<br/><em>The right cart.</em></h1><p class="hero-description">From a family visit to a multi-cart event, choose the seats and rental dates that work for you.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="#choose-cart">Explore the carts <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="quiet-link" href="#quote">Request a quote</a></div><p class="hero-footnote">2, 4 &amp; 6 passengers <span>•</span> Weekly &amp; monthly options</p></div><figure class="hero-photo"><img src="/golf cart images/fleet-aerial-2.jpg" alt="Golf carts arranged for fleet rentals" width="1080" height="1350" fetchpriority="high"/><figcaption><span>A little planning. A lot more freedom.</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></figcaption></figure></div></header><div class="planning-strip"><div class="wrap"><span>LET’S PLAN YOUR RENTAL</span><a href="#choose-cart">01 &nbsp; Choose your seats</a><a href="#plan-stay">02 &nbsp; Set your dates</a><a href="#quote-details">03 &nbsp; Check your quote</a></div></div>
<section id="choose-cart" class="section"><div class="wrap"><span class="step">01 / CHOOSE YOUR CART</span><h2>Good company. The right number of seats.</h2><p class="lead">Start with the number of passengers, then tell us what else you’ll carry. Passenger seats do not necessarily provide space for luggage or equipment.</p><div class="cards"><article class="card"><img src="/golf cart images/2-passenger-golf-cart-1.jpg" alt="2-passenger rental golf cart" width="600" height="400" loading="lazy"/><div class="card-body"><span class="card-label">YOUR RENTAL OPTIONS</span><h3>2 passengers</h3><p>For one or two people. Tell us if you also need space for golf bags or other equipment.</p><a href="/2-passenger-golf-cart-rental-ocala/">See the 2-passenger cart</a></div><section id="quote" class="quote-panel"><div class="wrap quote-grid"><div><p class="kicker">LET’S GET THE DETAILS RIGHT</p><h2>Tell us what<br/><em>you’re planning.</em></h2><p>Your dates, passenger count and delivery area help us prepare a useful quote.</p><p>Planning an event? Include the venue and number of carts in your message.</p></div><form name="reservation" method="POST" action="/thank-you" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field" class="space-y-4 bg-white rounded-lg border border-gray-200 p-6 shadow-sm">
            <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="reservation" />
            <p class="hidden"><label>Don't fill this out if you're human: <input name="bot-field" /></label></p>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
              <div>
                <label for="first-name" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">First name *</label>
                <input type="text" id="first-name" name="first-name" required autocomplete="given-name" class="w-full border border-gray-300 rounded-md px-3 py-2 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500 focus:border-emerald-500 outline-none" />
              </div>
              <div>
                <label for="last-name" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">Last name *</label>
                <input type="text" id="last-name" name="last-name" required autocomplete="family-name" class="w-full border border-gray-300 rounded-md px-3 py-2 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500 focus:border-emerald-500 outline-none" />
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
              <div>
                <label for="phone" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">Phone *</label>
                <input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" required autocomplete="tel" inputmode="tel" placeholder="(352) 555-1234" class="w-full border border-gray-300 rounded-md px-3 py-2 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500 focus:border-emerald-500 outline-none" />
              </div>
              <div>
                <label for="email" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">Email *</label>
                <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@email.com" class="w-full border border-gray-300 rounded-md px-3 py-2 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500 focus:border-emerald-500 outline-none" />
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
              <div>
                <label for="cart-type" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">Cart size</label>
                <select id="cart-type" name="cart-type" class="w-full border border-gray-300 rounded-md px-3 py-2 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500 focus:border-emerald-500 outline-none bg-white">
                  <option value="">Not sure yet</option>
                  <option>2 Passenger</option>
                  <option>2 Passenger Deluxe</option>
                  <option>4 Passenger</option>
                  <option>4 Passenger Deluxe</option>
                  <option>6 Passenger</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div>
                <label for="rental-dates" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">Rental dates</label>
                <input type="text" id="rental-dates" name="rental-dates" placeholder="e.g. Sep 12–15" class="w-full border border-gray-300 rounded-md px-3 py-2 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500 focus:border-emerald-500 outline-none" />
              </div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="delivery-address" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">Delivery address (or "store pickup")</label>
              <input type="text" id="delivery-address" name="delivery-address" class="w-full border border-gray-300 rounded-md px-3 py-2 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500 focus:border-emerald-500 outline-none" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="message" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">Anything else we should know?</label>
              <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="3" class="w-full border border-gray-300 rounded-md px-3 py-2 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500 focus:border-emerald-500 outline-none"></textarea>
            </div>
            <label class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
              <input type="checkbox" name="sms-consent" value="yes" class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 rounded border-gray-400 text-emerald-600 focus:ring-emerald-500" />
              <span>It's OK to text me about my reservation.</span>
            </label>
            <button type="submit" class="w-full bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white font-bold py-3 px-6 rounded-md transition-colors">Request availability</button>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 text-center">A request does not confirm a booking. We’ll follow up with availability and pricing.</p>
          </form></div></section></article><article class="card"><img src="/golf cart images/4-passenger-golf-cart-rental.jpg" alt="4-passenger rental golf cart" width="600" height="400" loading="lazy"/><div class="card-body"><span class="card-label">YOUR RENTAL OPTIONS</span><h3>4 passengers</h3><p>For up to four people. Consider everyone riding together when choosing your cart.</p><a href="/4-passenger-golf-cart-rental-ocala/">See the 4-passenger cart</a></div></article><article class="card"><img src="/golf cart images/6-passenger-golf-cart-ocala.jpg" alt="6-passenger rental golf cart" width="600" height="400" loading="lazy"/><div class="card-body"><span class="card-label">YOUR RENTAL OPTIONS</span><h3>6 passengers</h3><p>For up to six people. For a larger group, ask about availability for multiple carts.</p><a href="/6-passenger-golf-cart-rental-ocala/">See the 6-passenger cart</a></div></article></div></div></section>
<section id="plan-stay" class="section"><div class="wrap split"><div><span class="step">02 / PLAN YOUR STAY</span><h2>Your dates matter.</h2><p>Request pricing for your exact arrival and departure dates. A weekly package divided by seven is not necessarily a daily rate you can book for a shorter stay.</p><div class="links"><a href="/weekly-rental/">Weekly rentals</a><a href="/monthly-rental/">Monthly rentals</a></div></div><div><h3>Staying longer or planning ahead?</h3><p>Organizing several carts for an event? Include the venue, cart quantities, passenger or equipment needs, and delivery and pickup windows.</p><a href="/fleet-rentals/">Plan a fleet rental</a><p>Need to extend an existing rental? Contact the team before your scheduled return to check availability and the additional cost.</p></div></div></section>
<section id="quote-details" class="section"><div class="wrap split"><div><span class="step">03 / CHECK THE TOTAL</span><h2>Compare the whole quote.</h2><p>Pricing depends on the cart, dates, length of rental and delivery arrangements. Ask for the total for your booking, with any applicable charges explained.</p><a href="/contact/">Request availability and pricing</a></div><aside class="note"><h3>Before you reserve, confirm:</h3><ul><li>Rental charge and minimum rental period</li><li>Delivery, pickup and any fuel charges</li><li>Taxes and any payment-related fees</li><li>Deposit, payment and cancellation terms</li><li>Delivery timing and who to call for help</li></ul></aside></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap"><h2>Before you book.</h2><details><summary>How do I get a price for my rental?</summary><p>Call (352) 780-1526 or send a request with your dates, passenger count and delivery area. Ask the team to confirm availability and a complete quote for those details.</p></details><details><summary>Can I ask about a rental without an exact delivery address?</summary><p>Yes. Share the neighborhood or area you expect to stay in and explain that the address is pending. The team can discuss what information is needed before confirming your reservation and delivery.</p></details><details><summary>What if I’m booking for a group?</summary><p>Tell us the total number of people, how many carts you need, and whether you need to carry equipment. For events, include the venue and delivery and pickup windows so the team can discuss arrangements.</p></details></div></section>
<footer class="closing"><div class="wrap"><h2>Ready to check your dates?</h2><p>Bring your plans. We’ll help you work through the cart and booking details.</p><a class="button" href="tel:+13527801526">Call (352) 780-1526</a></div></footer></article>
</Layout><style>
.guide{color:#193b30;background:#fbfaf6;font-family:Arial,sans-serif}.guide *{box-sizing:border-box}.wrap{max-width:1200px;margin:auto;padding:0 28px}.hero{padding:44px 0 54px}.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:50px;align-items:center}.hero-copy{padding:25px 0}.kicker{font-size:11px!important;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}.kicker span{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#688c44}.guide h1{font-size:clamp(48px,6.7vw,88px);font-weight:500;line-height:1.01;letter-spacing:-.065em;text-transform:none;margin:27px 0}.guide h1 em{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;color:#678052}.hero-description{max-width:400px;font-size:18px!important;color:#526258}.hero-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:26px;margin-top:32px}.button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:30px;padding:17px 23px;background:#193b30;color:#fff!important;border-radius:5px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none!important;min-height:52px}.button:hover{background:#315a41}.quiet-link{font-size:14px;font-weight:700}.hero-footnote{font-size:12px!important;margin-top:28px!important;color:#607164}.hero-footnote span{margin:0 9px}.hero-photo{margin:0;position:relative;border-radius:160px 12px 12px 12px;overflow:hidden;background:#dfe7d9;height:570px}.hero-photo img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.hero-photo:after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:50% 0 0;background:linear-gradient(transparent,#112d25b8)}.hero-photo figcaption{position:absolute;z-index:1;bottom:28px;left:28px;right:28px;color:white;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;font-size:17px}.planning-strip{background:#e9eddf;border-top:1px solid #d9e0d0;border-bottom:1px solid #d9e0d0;padding:22px 0}.planning-strip .wrap{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:20px}.planning-strip span{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.12em;font-weight:700}.planning-strip a{font-size:13px;text-decoration:none!important}.section{padding:80px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dce2d6;scroll-margin-top:24px}.guide h2{font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,46px);line-height:1.12;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.045em;text-transform:none;margin:0 0 23px;max-width:650px}.guide h3{font-size:27px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.035em;text-transform:none;margin:0 0 15px}.guide p,.guide li{font-size:16px;line-height:1.75}.guide p{margin:0 0 18px}.lead{max-width:640px;color:#637064}.step{display:block;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.18em;color:#61774e;margin-bottom:20px}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:25px;margin-top:38px}.card{border-radius:9px;background:#f0f2ea;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #e2e7dc}.card img{width:100%;height:260px;object-fit:cover;transition:transform .3s}.card:hover img{transform:scale(1.025)}.card-body{padding:25px}.card-label{display:block;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.13em;color:#6c795e;margin-bottom:14px}.card p{font-size:15px;color:#5d6b5f}.card a{display:block;border-top:1px solid #d4ddcd;padding-top:18px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none!important}.card a:after{content:' ↗';float:right}.split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:80px}.note{padding:30px 36px;background:#e7ecdd;border-radius:6px}.guide ul{list-style:disc;padding-left:20px}.guide li+li{margin-top:12px}.guide a:not(.button){color:#193b30;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:5px}.guide details{border-bottom:1px solid #d5ddcd;padding:22px 0;max-width:900px}.guide summary{font-size:19px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:500}.guide details p{max-width:760px;color:#526258;margin-top:20px}.links{display:flex;gap:25px;margin-top:25px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700}.closing{background:#193b30;color:#fff;padding:58px 0}.closing .wrap{position:relative}.closing p{color:#d4dfcc}.closing .button{background:#dce9bc;color:#193b30!important}.guide a:focus-visible,.guide summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #b87920;outline-offset:5px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.card img{transition:none}}@media(max-width:750px){.hero-grid,.cards,.split{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:30px}.wrap{padding:0 22px}.hero{padding:15px 0 30px}.hero h1{font-size:62px}.hero-copy{padding:18px 0 0}.hero-photo{height:420px;border-radius:100px 10px 10px 10px}.hero-actions{gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap}.hero-footnote{font-size:11px!important}.planning-strip .wrap{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:15px}.planning-strip span{width:100%}.planning-strip a{font-size:11px}.section{padding:48px 0}.card img{height:280px}.note{padding:24px}.guide h2{font-size:34px}}
.quote-panel{background:#193b30;padding:70px 0;color:#fff}.quote-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:70px}.quote-panel h2{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:49px}.quote-panel p{max-width:380px;color:#d5dfcb}.quote-panel form{color:#193b30;padding:30px;border-radius:10px;background:#fbfaf6}.quote-panel form p{color:#596954}.quote-panel input,.quote-panel select,.quote-panel textarea{min-height:46px;border:1px solid #b8c5b1}.quote-panel input[type=checkbox]{min-height:18px}.quote-panel button{background:#193b30}.quote-panel form label{font-size:14px}@media(max-width:750px){.quote-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:25px}.quote-panel h2{font-size:40px}.quote-panel form{padding:23px}}
</style>